  "content": {
    "problemStatement": "With an integer array `nums`, *find three numbers whose product is largest and output the largest product*.\n\n**Example 1:**\n\n```\nInput: nums = [1,2,3]\nOutput: 6\n```\n\n**Example 2:**\n\n```\nInput: nums = [1,2,3,4]\nOutput: 24\n```\n\n**Example 3:**\n\n```\nInput: nums = [-1,-2,-3]\nOutput: -6\n```\n\n**Constraints:**\n\n* `3 <= nums.length <= 104`\n* `-1000 <= nums[i] <= 1000`",
    "constraints": [
      "None"
    ],
    "inputFormat": "Single line: JSON array of all arguments, e.g. [arg1, arg2, ...]",
    "outputFormat": "Single line: JSON-serialised return value",
